7aas|n|That which is capable of being affirmed; reality. ; That which settles by absolute appointment. ; The positive degree or form. ; A picture in which the lights and shades correspond in position with those of the original, instead of being reversed, as in a negative. ; The positive plate of a voltaic or electrolytic cell.	v:705w,12,5~705w,12,5	N:1xpv,28,3;92qq,4,2;7vay,2,1~1xpv,28,3;92qq,4,2;7vay,2,1
